      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Returned to his hospital bed, Chef Barinov is scolded by the nurse for climbing out the window and driving his blood pressure up. When Vika arrives to visit the supposedly weak patient, she catches him happily devouring smuggled meat with a huge appetite.",
